WEBVTT

00:02:58.049 --> 00:03:01.260
and we worry that our child
won't be good enough.

00:03:01.302 --> 00:03:03.638
Won't be good enough for the soccer team,

00:03:03.679 --> 00:03:05.681
won't be ready for kindergarten,

00:03:05.723 --> 00:03:08.017
won't be as smart as their classmates.

00:03:08.809 --> 00:03:12.813
And we worry that if our child
doesn't measure up,

00:03:12.813 --> 00:03:14.523
it will be our fault.

00:03:15.775 --> 00:03:21.489
Our hyperfocus on our children
and our students’s success is backfiring.

00:03:21.948 --> 00:03:26.035
And it's exacerbated
by two forces I see impacting

00:03:26.077 --> 00:03:28.913
the large majority
of parents and teachers.

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:33.042
First, the need
for immediate gratification